$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Primal V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling for survival on the planet of Primal V.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag for a capture. It's a Str8 Shot across to the enemy's base so be careful. Good Luck and may the best Tribe prove successful!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W.  (XGN LadyShar) Pick up all my Tribes Maps at http://welcome.to/LadyShars" @
         "\n\n<f1> Custom Maps: <f0> Need a custom map for your Tribe or Server, head on over to Mappers Extreme site at http://www.planetstarsiege.com/extreme";